'''Zarina''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Trade Center}} that allows the player to upgrade the {{Item|Midas' Sword}} and {{Item|Midas Staff}} by increasing the price paid for the items. This costs the price difference as well as {{Item|Stock of Stonks|amount=3}}.

